# Lesson 31.5 - planar ammonia, the inversion transition state, at r2SCAN-3c.
# OptTS follows one negative-curvature mode uphill; Calc_Hess computes the exact Hessian first.
# ORCA 6.1.1:  orca 05_nh3_ts.inp > 05_nh3_ts.out
! r2SCAN-3c OptTS Freq
%maxcore 1000
%geom
  Calc_Hess true
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ../molecules/ammonia_planar.xyz
